{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar leaf mark — vector.

  The silhouette is traced from the merchant's own logo (both leaves, with
  the sliver cut in the large one) and rendered as brushed steel: banded
  metal gradients tuned to each leaf's own bounds, a dark bevel rim with a
  bright inner line, a diagonal gloss sweep, a fine brushed texture and a
  soft drop shadow.

  Why vector rather than the supplied PNG: theme files sent as BASE64 come
  back corrupted through this API even when the byte count matches, and a
  base64 data URI inside a Liquid file would not decode. SVG is plain text,
  so it transfers intact — and it stays sharp at any size on any screen.

  Use: {% render 'besjaar-leaf-logo' %} and size it with CSS on .bj-leaf.
{%- endcomment -%}
